SUMMARY:Special Event: Funny Women Of A Certain Age
LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 2031 Sansom Street\, Philadelphia
DESCRIPTION:"If I had to choose between ageism or sexism\, I'd take a pat o
 n the behind any day\, since that meant someone noticed me.”\n\nCarole Mo
 ntgomery\, creator of Funny Women of A Certain Age\n\nWhat began as a way t
 o work with her friends has exploded on the comedy scene. When Carole (a ve
 teran of the stand-up scene for over 40 years) started\, you would never se
 e two female comics on the same show. Fast forward to today’s comedy scen
 e\, and nothing has changed\, even though there are way more women in comed
 y.\n\nFunny Women or WOACA was created to give older women comics a chance 
 to be seen and heard. Frustrated with how women are portrayed on television
  once they hit 50\, Carole decided to do something about it. She’s fighti
 ng ageism AND sexism one joke at a time. The women who appear in WOACA are 
 all funny\, vibrant\, and brilliant\; they happen to be of a certain age. T
 hese women paved the way for the female comics you see today.\n\nCouple's P
 ackage includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit ($45 pe
 r person)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Protection\n\nManagement reserves the right
  to prevent customers they deem disruptive or dangerous to other patrons fr
 om entering the facility.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/
 event/special-event-funny-women-of-a-certain-age/
